        "candidate_id": "C_10f9341e9f81a3d4_0",
        "edit": "No change: the supplied RTL already decodes ABC=3'b101 to X=1,Y=0, which matches the oracle observation (expected 10 at cycle0); the reported mismatch is not reproducible from this RTL, so no local patch is applicable.",
